{"id": "34183", "title": "遇见百分百冤家", "author": "安婕", "category": "文学名著", "count": 13, "available": 12, "cover": "", "status": "已完成", "source": "files/article/info/34/34183.htm", "intro": "他，风流倜傥，游戏人间， \r\n    是台北富家的纨绔子弟。 \r\n    她，认真美丽，个性刚强， \r\n    是远方渔港市场的年轻女老板。 \r\n    他们针锋相对，互相捉弄， \r\n    当真天生一对、地设一双的——冤家，     他不服气她的高傲， \r\n    决定纡尊降贵，到渔港应征搬货工人， \r\n    一场充满报复性的爱情游戏于焉展开， \r\n    哪知老天捉弄，竟然让他们假爱成真， \r\n    在重新审视彼此间的情意， \r\n    他们都面临了爱的迷惑。", "base": "files/article/html/34/34183", "chapters": [{"title": "第一章", "file": "2172406.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第二章", "file": "2172407.html", "available": true}, {"title": "第三章", "file": "2172408.html", "available": true}, {"title": "第四章", "file": "2172409.html", "available": true}, {"title": "第五章", "file": "2172410.html", "available": true}, {"title": "第六章", "file": "2172411.html", "available": true}, {"title": "第七章", "file": "2172412.html", "available": true}, {"title": "第八章", "file": "2172413.html", "available": true}, {"title": "第九章", "file": "2172414.html", "available": true}, {"title": "第十章", "file": "2172415.html", "available": true}, {"title": "第十一章", "file": "2172416.html", "available": true}, {"title": "第十二章", "file": "2172417.html", "available": true}, {"title": "第十三章", "file": "2172418.html", "available": true}]}